From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Elsbrock <simon@iodev.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:08:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] clk: mediatek: add the MT8519 clocks, ported to 6.12

The Echo Dot (5th gen) (cannoli) runs a MediaTek MT8519 (ADR 0035). Its
clock drivers come from Amazon's GPL kernel release
(Echo_Dot_5th_Gen_src-6.5.7.1, kernel/mediatek/5.4, MediaTek's
clk-mt8519*.c), forward-ported from that 5.4 vendor tree to 6.12's upstream
MediaTek clock framework:

- topckgen and infracfg_ao move to the declarative mtk_clk_desc with
  mtk_clk_simple_probe, as the upstream MT8516/MT8365 drivers do. The mux and
  audio divider-gate tables merge into one composite array (6.12's desc takes
  one), with a local DIV_GATE_FLAGS to keep CLK_DIVIDER_ROUND_CLOSEST, which
  upstream's DIV_GATE drops.
- apmixedsys keeps its own probe for the PLLs (the desc has no PLL table),
  using clk_hw_onecell_data and mtk_devm_alloc_clk_data, after the MT8167
  sibling.
- The clock-ID binding header and the gate-only sub-blocks (pericfg,
  imp_iic_wrap_ao/peri, m4u, nna, rv33sys_cfg) are MediaTek's, unchanged
  beyond the 6.12 provider API.

CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_MT8519 is off in every current variant, so this builds on
the MT8163 and MT8516 kernels without being compiled. It is the first layer
of the MT8519 kernel series.

Co-authored-by: MediaTek Inc. <wentao.he@mediatek.com>
---
 drivers/clk/mediatek/Kconfig                  |   8 +
 drivers/clk/mediatek/Makefile                 |   3 +
 .../clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-imp_iic_wrap_ao.c |  73 ++
 .../mediatek/clk-mt8519-imp_iic_wrap_peri.c   |  65 ++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-m4u.c         |  62 ++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-nna.c         |  85 ++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-pericfg.c     |  62 ++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-rv33sys_cfg.c |  64 ++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519.c             | 927 ++++++++++++++++++
 include/dt-bindings/clock/mt8519-clk.h        | 345 +++++++
 10 files changed, 1694 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-imp_iic_wrap_ao.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-imp_iic_wrap_peri.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-m4u.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8519-nna.c
